umentation, and data processing records; (6) Academic literature on AI privacy risks, memorization in large language models, and privacy-preserving machine learning techniques; (7) Industry standards and frameworks for AI privacy (NIST AI Risk Management Framework, ISO/IEC 27001, privacy engineering guidelines); (8) Incident response records documenting previous privacy breaches or near-misses; (9) Third-party security assessments and penetration testing results; (10) Privacy impact assessments and data protection impact assessments conducted during system development.	Other	Other	data	Technical Risks	Security Risk; Data Risk
