8542	RISK-1194	A0867_UK Government2023	Identification of AI-generated content	Content Safety Controls	Research techniques that allow AI-generated content to be identified. Invest in researching how AI-generated content may be watermarked, including AI- generated text, photos and videos, and experiment with the implementation of such techniques. It is particularly technically difficult to attach watermarks and prove the provenance of text.One method could involve making the model more statistically likely to use certain phrases or words in a way that is unnoticeable to humans, but can be picked up by a detector, provided a long enough sequence of text. However, this approach may not be robust to attempts to scrub off the watermark e.g. by having another AI model paraphrase the text.
