8720	RISK-19	A0825_UK Government2023	Tracking Tools for Security and Version Control Assets	Model & Infrastructure Security	Have processes and tools to track, authenticate, secure and version control assets and be able to roll back to a known safe state in the event of a compromise. This is important as data and models do not remain static during the whole lifespan of an AI project.
