2917	RISK-343	A0010_Bengio2025	Model Evaluation	Testing & Auditing	Processes to assess and measure an AI system's performance on a particular task.There are countless AI evaluations to assess different capabilities and risks, including for security.
2918	RISK-343	A1012_Gipiškis2024	Using an AI model to evaluate AI model outputs	Testing & Auditing	In cases where the outputs of AI models cannot be easily evaluated, AI mod- els can be used to evaluate their outputs or the outputs of other AI models [82, 16, 17, 91]. The evaluations can then provide a training signal to improve the original model’s performance or offer explanations of the output for human users.
