1347	RISK-357	A1009_Gipiškis2024	Test robustness of GPAI system on relevant benchmarks	Testing & Auditing	Various benchmarks [52, 236] have been developed to assess the robustness of GPAI systems when deployed in environments or scenarios that differ from their training conditions. These benchmarks typically evaluate the model’s ability to handle variations in inputs, unexpected data distributions, or adversarial examples, aiming to ensure reliable performance outside the original training domain.
