10984	RISK-409	A0929_UK Government2023	Harmful Data for Reduction of Dangerous Capabilities	Model Alignment	For some kinds of risks, explore options to use harmful data to reduce AI systems’ dangerous capabilities or to help develop mitigation tools. For example, by fine-tuning a system using labelled harmful content to refuse requests related to the harmful information.
