13066	RISK-669	A0918_UK Government2023	Audits for Private or Sensitive Information	Data Governance	AI systems may be subject to data extraction attacks, where determined users can prompt systems to reveal pieces of training data, or may even reveal this information accidentally. This makes it important to know whether datasets include private or sensitive information e.g. names, addresses, or security vulnerabilities.
