13448	RISK-685	A0919_UK Government2023	Audits for Biases in the Data	Data Governance	Training data that is imbalanced or inaccurate can result in an AI system being less accurate for people with certain personal characteristics or providing a skewed picture of particular groups. Ensuring a better balance in the training data could help to address this.
